# Fixtures that render + validate in scripts/test-charts.sh but are not deployed by the default
# `make e2e` sweep (name one in E2E_CASES to force it). The deployed ones, published, metrics
# and oidc, run against the throwaway PostgreSQL in ci/e2e-setup.sh and publish nginx; these
# would need more than that to prove anything a render does not:
#   default, tls-off  Traefik exposure: converging proves nothing without an edge in front.
#   none              exposure.network for an operator's own proxy, which e2e does not have.
#   ephemeral         the render-check covers the no-volume, no-pin shape.
#   bind-mount        host directories and a node label on a data node.
#   s3                an S3 store on rustfs-net.
#   config            CONFIG_OVERWRITE_JSON set directly, without OIDC; the oidc case deploys
#                     the wrapper-built one, which Harbor reads the same way.
default
tls-off
none
ephemeral
bind-mount
s3
config
